  {
   "key": "3267750507085099016",
   "en": "Yeah?",
   "ro": "Da?"
  },
  {
   "key": "3267750507252871176",
   "en": "Yeah… Got my own iron… Well, yeah, 's modded… Nah, do my own maintenance… Yeah…",
